"is supported in Godot 4.x. As a workaround, increase the screensaver's "
"timeout period to make it less likely to occur during gameplay."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/tutorials/inputs/controllers_gamepads_joysticks.rst:253
msgid ""
"You can view a list of `known issues with controller support <https://github."
"com/godotengine/godot/issues?"
"q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3Atopic%3Ainput+gamepad>`__ on GitHub."
msgstr ""
